      "title": "Add ENC_TIME_NSECS timestamp encoding",
      "message": "Add ENC_TIME_NSECS timestamp encoding\n\nAdd a new timestamp encoding format ENC_TIME_NSECS, like ENC_TIME_SEC but\nfor nanosecond values. Needed for my work-in-progress dissector for Apple\npush notifications.\n",
      "author_name": "Nicolás Alvarez",
      "author_email": "nicolas.alvarez@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-02-03T18:12:29.000-03:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
